==Battleground==
*1 [[Formicidaean Ariant]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*2 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*2 [[Formicidaean Ariant]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*1 [[Zory]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Crustaceous Scissorex]] spawns as the boss.
**4 [[Formicidaean Ariant]]s spawn, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Wild Doge]]s spawn, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
**4 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.
**3 [[Zory|Zories]] spawn, delay 46.67~50 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The enemies can take you by surprise by burrowing and shredding through all your defenses. Research [[Cat Combo]]s such as [[Biohazard (Combo)|Biohazard]] and [[Bony Bone (Combo)|Bony Bone]], with [[Courier Cat]] will be of great use here. Formicidaean Ariant can gain ground easily, so use [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] to nuke him and [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife Cat]] to slow and [[Zombie Killer|Z-kill]] it. They both benefit from the aforementioned combos.

